== Trivia ==
* Purgatory is a place or state of suffering inhabited by the souls of sinners who are expiating their sins before going to heaven.
* Purgatory is one of only five items to appear in both the Angel and Devil item pools, the others being {{i|7 Seals}}, {{i|Duality}}, {{i|Lil Delirium}} and {{i|Void}}.

